        ex:hasText "In conclusion, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, API integration, and environmental sustainability makes Nexus Engineering S.r.l. a suitable partner for the City of Belval's initiative to implement an intelligent assistance tool for the City of Belval's municipal agents. a comprehensive solution to design, implement, and deploy an artificial intelligence (AI) powered intelligent assistance tool for the City of Belval's municipal agents meets the City of Belval's requirements for high availability, low latency, and environmental responsibility while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and optimizing costs." ;
