        ex:hasText "Technical constraints 5.1 Performance The expected solution will have to provide times of response compatible with a daily use by the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk45> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk46> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk47> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk48> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Interfaces of API type will be expected. 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Sovereignty constraints the local authority grants a particular importance to the sovereignty of the data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk5> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution will have to allow to provide to the agents an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from the agents work environment, capable of accompanying the agents in the agents administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities could notably bear on: the search for information in the internal procedures and the applicable regulation, the help with the drafting of letters or of answers to the users, the accompaniment in the instruction of files (town planning, social aids, civil status, etc.), the suggestion of actions or of steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the hosting will have to be realized on an infrastructure of SecNumCloud type or equivalent, a particular attention will be brought to the dependence vis-à-vis non-European suppliers. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Budgetary constraints The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 3 million euros over a duration of 4 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The annual cost of exploitation will have to remain mastered and compatible with the budgetary capacities of the local authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk53> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose an approach allowing to optimize the costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk54> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk55> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk56> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk57> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An accompaniment to the change and actions of training of the agents will be expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk58> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Criteria of evaluation of the offers the offers will be evaluated with regard to the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution, compliance to the regulatory requirements, level of security, global cost of the proposed solution, taking into account of the environmental issues, capacity of innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy, the objective is to improve the efficiency of administrative services and quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution into the existing practices of the agents and not constitute a rupture in the agents modes of work. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project involves designing, implementing, and deploying an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's past public sector references that align with the objective, and how can our company's consolidate all agent contributions into a coherent tender response? our company's, has relevant past references in the public sector that align with the City of Belval's digital transformation strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our company's have completed projects for Comune di Torino, Regione Lombardia, and Métropole de Lyon." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project for Regione Lombardia involved an AI-powered document management system, which shares similarities with the objective of designing and implementing an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To consolidate all agent contributions into a coherent tender response, our company's can leverage our company's experience in managing multiple stakeholders and partners, as demonstrated by our company's consortium experience having led 8 consortia with up to 5 partners. our company's governance tools, such as RAID logs, decision logs, and change request processes, will ensure that all contributions are tracked and incorporated into the tender response." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk65> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's reporting cadence, including weekly status reports and monthly steering committee meetings, will facilitate communication and coordination among team members. our company's dedicated change manager and training delivery capabilities can also support the City of Belval's in adopting the new AI solution, ensuring a smooth transition for municipal agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk66> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By highlighting these strengths and past references, our company's can demonstrate our company's expertise and capabilities in delivering complex public sector projects, increasing our company's chances of submitting a successful tender response." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk67> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval requires an intelligent assistance tool with functionalities including assistance with consultation of information, drafting, instruction of files, collaboration, and continuity of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk68> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must integrate with existing systems, provide response times below 2 seconds, guarantee high availability (99.9%), and be hosted on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk69> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design the technical architecture to meet these requirements, and what are the proposed interfaces for API integration?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design the technical architecture for The solution, I would propose a cloud-based solution leveraging we expertise in AI/ML systems, cloud architecture, and API integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirement for high availability and low latency, we can utilize a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, such as Outscale, which we have experience with. the technical architecture for the City of Belval's intelligent assistance tool would consist of a microservices-based design, with separate services for natural language processing, document drafting, and collaboration. we would employ containerization using Docker and orchestration with Kubernetes to ensure scalability and high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For the AI/ML component, we can utilize we experience with LLaMA 3 or Mistral 7B models, fine-tuned using LoRA or QLoRA methods to achieve high accuracy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The model would be deployed on an inference server such as vLLM or Ollama, which would provide fast response times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems, we would propose API-based interfaces using REST or GraphQL standards, leveraging we experience with API gateways such as Kong or Apigee. we would also ensure that the solution is compatible with The City of Belval existing identity providers, such as Active Directory or LDAP." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk75> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security, we would implement a zero-trust network architecture, utilizing VLAN segmentation, mTLS between services, and encryption using AES-256 at rest and TLS 1.3 in transit. we would also utilize secrets management tools such as HashiCorp Vault to ensure secure storage and retrieval of sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk76> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the response time requirement, we would optimize the solution using quantisation methods such as INT8 or INT4, and ensure that the infrastructure is properly scaled to handle the expected load. we would also implement monitoring using Prometheus and Grafana to ensure that the solution is performing within the required parameters." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk77> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed interfaces for API integration would include: * REST APIs for document drafting and collaboration services * GraphQL APIs for natural language processing and information consultation services * SOAP or CMIS APIs for integration with existing GED systems such as Alfresco or OpenKM * Identity provider APIs such as SAML 2.0 or OpenID Connect for authentication and authorization By leveraging we expertise in AI/ML, cloud architecture, and API integration, we can design a technical architecture that meets The City of Belval requirements for an intelligent assistance tool, providing fast response times, high availability, and secure integration with existing systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk78> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval demands strict compliance with GDPR regulations, including exclusive hosting within the EU, no data transfer outside the EU, encryption, and anonymization of sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also provide explicability and transparency of recommendations, with no automated decisions without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk8> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to be in measure to contextualize the answers in function of the demand of the agent. 3.2 Assistance with the drafting The expected solution will have to propose a help with the drafting of administrative contents, notably: answers to the users, administrative letters, syntheses of files." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's security controls and certifications that align with these requirements, and how can our company's ensure compliance?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has several security controls and certifications that align with these requirements. our company's hold ISO 27001 certification with a scope that includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, which expires on November 30, 2026." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's have appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO) who can be contacted at dpo@nexus-engineering.it." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of data residency, our company's standard policy is to store data within the EU, and our company's prohibit cross-border transfers by default unless there is an explicit legal basis for doing so. our company's also utilize anonymization tools, including Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, to protect sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explicability and transparency of recommendations, our company's AI security controls include output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's implement model isolation through an inference API, which prevents direct model access for end-users. our company's model update security review process also ensures that any changes to the models are thoroughly vetted. our company's can ensure compliance with these requirements by leveraging our company's existing data subject rights implementation, which includes access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection. our company's also have the capability to conduct Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) with an average duration of three weeks. our company's access control standards, including multi-factor authentication (MFA) enforced through TOTP and hardware tokens (FIDO2), Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) design experience, and Privileged Access Management (PAM) solutions such as CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault, will help prevent unauthorized access to sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, our company's incident response plan, which includes a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and breach notification within 72 hours, will ensure that our company's can respond promptly and effectively in the event of a security incident." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, explicability, and transparency of the AI solution, as well as responsibility for automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval also expects the holder to guarantee a high level of availability and performance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are our company's legal risks and compliance posture regarding a high level of availability and performance, and how can our company's flag potential issues?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience with GDPR compliance, as indicated by our company's standard legal basis under Article 6(1)(e) for data processing. our company's also have a Data Protection Agreement template version 3.2 in place and offer support for Data Protection Impact Assessments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's should note that our company's default setting is not to process sensitive data, so if The tender requires such processing, such processing would be an exception to our company's standard practice." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding AI transparency and explicability, our company's has expertise in EU AI Act compliance, including awareness of prohibited AI practices and the requirements for human oversight over automated decisions. our company's have a policy of not allowing automated decision-making without human validation, which aligns with the expectations for responsibility in automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For availability and performance guarantees, our company's standard contractual clauses include a penalty mechanism for Service Level Agreement (SLA) breaches, providing a level of assurance for The City of Belval requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's should carefully review the specific SLA requirements of The tender to ensure the specific SLA requirements of the tender align with our company's standard provisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential issues to flag include ensuring that our company's AI solution complies with evolving EU AI Act requirements and monitoring updates to evolving EU AI Act requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, while our company's have a policy against automated decision-making without human oversight, our company's need to confirm that a policy against automated decision-making without human oversight aligns with The City of Belval specific expectations for responsibility in automated decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, confirming that our company's data processing practices, including any potential cross-border data flows within the EU, comply with GDPR requirements is essential." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain mastered and compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder must propose an approach allowing cost optimization while guaranteeing quality of service expected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

